rres is a header-only library.

Include <rres.h> to use the core resource format API.

The raylib integration is available through <rres-raylib.h>. Define
RRES_RAYLIB_IMPLEMENTATION in exactly one source file before including it.
Optional compression/encryption support can be enabled with
RRES_SUPPORT_COMPRESSION_LZ4, RRES_SUPPORT_ENCRYPTION_AES, and
RRES_SUPPORT_ENCRYPTION_XCHACHA20.
